        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21RNWVETjROblJvYUV3MFZEZGFlRlEwWjNFMmFIYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404019e61121209:0x9b14ee72ba0f1547"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJCRISYZ4BBDQRRxUPunLuFJs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNdGN6RkdNa1ZLUmxwT1JtZzJVbXRmYkdGMVVYYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "10/10\n\nThe Station 不僅僅是一家咖啡店，更像是一個社區中心，尤其以跑步愛好者群體為核心。\n\n自從搬到香港後，我參加過許多不同的跑步俱樂部，但很幸運地發現了 The Station，它一直是 Wazup Run Club 的聚集地。\n\n跑步活動每週三晚上 7:30 和週六早上 7:30 舉行。這裡氛圍友好，無論你的速度如何，都歡迎加入。\n\n我強烈推薦鳳梨芒果冰沙，而且跑步結束後還能享受 10% 的折扣。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "10/10\n\nThe station is more than just a coffee shop. I would consider more as a community focal point, with a strong focus around the running community.\n\nSince moving to Hong Kong I have participated in may different run clubs, but I was lucky to find The Station and it has been the gathering point for the Wazup Run Club.\n\nRuns take place Wednesdays at 7:30pm, Saturdays at 7:30am. It’s been a great welcoming community and regardless of your pace everyone is welcome.\n\nI would definitely recommend trying the pineapple mango smoothie and you’ll also get a 10% off after the run.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Pirelli Guide",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101251645685016646835/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKfjqm-YxM-xSwWXWQWnFVYLoCerQrpTd8YbchI3kZZF3l1TQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-03-14T10:00:55.205621505Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNdGN6RkdNa1ZLUmxwT1JtZzJVbXRmYkdGMVVYYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNdGN6RkdNa1ZLUmxwT1JtZzJVbXRmYkdGMVVYYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404019e61121209:0x9b14ee72ba0f1547"
